// between the prologue and the first label or jump - so the store dominates every use - and its
// address is never taken; the descriptor it holds is SEQ-STABLE, so the fields read at the store are
// the fields everywhere. An accessor of it is an element accessor (40, 41, 42, 44, 47..51) whose rdi
// was loaded from the slot within the same straight line. `dacc[i]` is the slice (+1) line i reads.
